
PocketCHIP running Debian 10 (buster) - community build
https://github.com/ddtdanilo/pocketchip-debian

  * Default login is chip / chip. Change it now:  passwd
  * SSH is enabled. FTP and VNC are installed but OFF. Turn them on with:
        sudo pocketchip-services enable-vnc
        sudo pocketchip-services enable-ftp
  * Wi-Fi:  sudo nmcli dev wifi connect "<ssid>" password "<password>"
  * Run "sudo apt update" before installing packages.

